  "job_B3.2.8_20261117_184009": {
    "chunk_text": "e Cw\u00e6\u00fe se godspellere, H\u00e6lend ferde \u00fe\u00e6r for\u00fe, & \u00fea gehyrde \u00feone blindan cleopian, & he sona gestod, Gehyra\u00fe we nu \u00fe\u00e6t seo mennisce gecynd bi\u00fe a f\u00e6rende, & seo godcunde meht a sta\u00feolf\u00e6stlice stonde\u00fe. Hw\u00e6t h\u00e6fde seo godcunde \u00feurh \u00fea menniscan nemne buton \u00fe\u00e6t heo mihte beon acenned, & wacian, & \u00deonne mar\u00feon \u00fe\u00e6re godcundnesse n\u00e6nig onwendnesse on carcerne w\u00e6s of \u00fe\u00e6re menniscan gecynde, He bi\u00f0 a wesende, & \u00e6ghw\u00e6r ondweard, & \u00e6lce stowe he gefyl\u00fe & ufan oferwryh\u00fe, & a bi\u00fe ece. \u00de\u00e6t us tacna\u00fe \u00fe\u00e6t he \u00feurh \u00fea menniscan gecynd ure stefne blindnesse gehyre\u00fe; \u00feonne we ure synna Eac is to ge\u00feencenne hw\u00e6t Drihten spr\u00e6c, \u00fea se blinda to him com; he cw\u00e6\u00fe, Hw\u00e6t wilt \u00feu \u00fe\u00e6t ic \u00fee N\u00e6s \u00fe\u00e6t ne \u00fe\u00e6t he nyste hw\u00e6t se blinda wolde, se ealle \u00feing wat, & him leoht forgeaf; ah Drihten Gelimplice he us l\u00e6rde & monade, hu we us gebiddan sceoldan, & hw\u00e6\u00feere cw\u00e6\u00fe, Eower F\u00e6der se We magan ongytan \u00fe\u00e6t he for\u00feon us gesette \u00fe\u00e6t we hine biddan sceoldan, \u00fey we sceolan \u00feonne eac, Gehyran we eac \u00fe\u00e6t se blinda ne b\u00e6d goldes, ne seolfres, ne worldglenga, ah b\u00e6d his eagena leohtes",
